1
00:00:00,360 --> 00:00:01,960
No one would have believed

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:04,722
in the last years
of the nineteenth century

3
00:00:04,722 --> 00:00:08,306
that this world was being watched
keenly and closely

4
00:00:08,306 --> 00:00:11,524
by intelligences greater than man’s

5
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:23,120
It was the beginning
of the rout of civilisation,

6
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:25,514
of the massacre of mankind.
